source: crates/stems-cli/src/help.rs
assertion_line: 495
expression: "features_text(Some(\"repos\"))"
---
Code from git (stems features repos)
  Git codebases — A `codebase:` can be a git URL: stems clones and fetches it; `stems repos
    status` shows where each one is.
    commands: stems repos sync, stems repos status
    config:   repos_dir, stems.*.codebase
    docs:     docs/repos.md
  Checking out a ref — `stems repos checkout <stem> <ref>` switches a stem's codebase to a branch,
    tag or commit.
    commands: stems repos checkout
    docs:     docs/repos.md

`stems features <area>` narrows the list, `--json` gives the table, `stems docs <topic>` prints a page.
